    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586540/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748222881\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newspaper ad inspires a girl to become a test subject for some quick cash. She is hired to test her limits with a tube-feeding machine, and must reach her full capacity! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have two minutes to fill her up! You control the tube-feeding machine and must make sure there is enough pressure to fill her up fast enough, but not enough pressure for it to blow up. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girl who gains weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and replayable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button controls...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery to revisit how far you pushed her limits!  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Developed for the Weight Gaming's 'Push the Limits' Lo-Cal Gain Jam! Have fun!</i></p>",
